**/*.log*
**/.DS_Store

**/node_modules
/.pnpm-store

/.coverage

**/.eslintcache
**/coverage
# Go coverage profiles, from `go-test`
**/cover.out
# Rust build output, shared by the workspace in `Cargo.toml`
/target
**/dist
**/dist-test
# wrangler's local state and temporary bundles
**/.wrangler
# OpenTofu's providers and local state, from `tofu init`. The lock file is committed
**/.terraform
# Saved plans hold the state's values (encrypted, but never committed)
**/*.tfplan
**/.swcrc

/.claude-config
/plans
# Nx's own files, but not its link to @leyman/main: see leyman/main/README.md
/.nx/*
!/.nx/installation
/.devcontainer/.env
